    "questionEn": "A river is flowing from west to east direction with speed of 9 km h − 1 . If a boat capable of moving at a maximum speed of 27 km h − 1 in still water, crosses the river in half a minute, while moving with maximum speed at an angle of 150 ∘ to direction of river flow, then the width of the river is :",
