    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement (I) : The radii of isoelectronic species increases in the order. Mg 2+ < Na + < F − < O 2- Statement (II) : The magnitude of electron gain enthalpy of halogen decreases in the order. Cl > F > Br > I In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :",
