    "shift": 1,
    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Standard entropies of X 2 , Y 2 and XY 5 are 70, 50 and 110 J K − 1 mol − 1 respectively. The temperature in Kelvin at which the reaction 1 2 X 2 + 5 2 Y 2 ⇌ XY 5 Δ H ⊖ = − 35 kJ mol − 1 will be at equilibrium is __________ (Nearest integer)",
