    "questionEn": "A plano-convex lens having radius of curvature of first surface 2 cm exhibits focal length of f 1 in air. Another plano-convex lens with first surface radius of curvature 3 cm has focal length of f 2 when it is immersed in a liquid of refractive index 1.2. If both the lenses are made of same glass of refractive index 1.5 , the ratio of f 1 and f 2 will be",
