    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "An air bubble of radius 1.0 mm is observed at a depth 20 cm below the free surface of a liquid having surface tension 0.095 J / m 2 and density 10 3 kg / m 3 . The difference between pressure inside the bubble and atmospheric pressure is __________ N / m 2 . (Take g = 10 m / s 2 )",
