    "questionEn": "A spherical surface of radius of curvature R , separates air from glass (refractive index = 1.5 ). The centre of curvature is in the glass medium. A point object ' O ' placed in air on the optic axis of the surface, so that its real image is formed at 'I' inside glass. The line OI intersects the spherical surface at P and P O = P I . The distance P O equals to",
