    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement (I) : A spectral line will be observed for a 2 p x → 2 p y transition. Statement (II) : 2 p x and 2 p y are degenerate orbitals. In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
