    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "questionEn": "Let a ⃗ and b ⃗ be two unit vectors such that the angle between them is π 3 . If λ a ⃗ + 2 b ⃗ and 3 a ⃗ − λ b ⃗ are perpendicular to each other, then the number of values of λ in [ − 1 , 3 ] is :",
