    "shift": 2,
    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "questionEn": "In a group of 3 girls and 4 boys, there are two boys B 1 and B 2 . The number of ways, in which these girls and boys can stand in a queue such that all the girls stand together, all the boys stand together, but B 1 and B 2 are not adjacent to each other, is :",
